DESCRIPTION:Duration: 114 mins (1h54m)\n\nFor Your Consideration Eva Victo
 r (“Billions”) writes\, directs\, and stars in this nonlinear\, serioc
 omic story about a melancholic English professor’s complicated path towa
 rd healing in the aftermath of an all-to-common tragedy. Winner of the Sun
 dance 2025 Waldo Salt Screenwriting Award.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/program
 s-and-events/for-your-consideration/sorry-baby\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
